Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:05.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We live out our lives on the surgical unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:05.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们几乎天天泡在外科室
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.83,0:00:10.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seven days a week, 14 hours a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.83,0:00:10.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一周七天 一天14小时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're together more than we're apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可谓聚多离少
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:17.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}George's room is bigger than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治的房间比我的大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:23.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}After a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:23.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过了一阵子…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have more clothes I should have the bigger room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的衣服比较多 大房间应该给我才对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:27.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The ways of residency...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:27.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}…实习医生之道…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:29.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I got here first. - It's Meredith's house. She should decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:29.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 是我先来的 - 这是她家 由她决定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.46,0:00:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Become the ways of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.46,0:00:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}…变成了生活之道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My room is, like, two inches bigger than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的房间只比你的大一点点而已
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:34.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Number one...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}准则第一条…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:35.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have a bigger closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的衣柜比较大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.04,0:00:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why is everything a competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.04,0:00:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛什么都要比？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:38.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Always keep score.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:38.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}…凡事斤斤计较
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.88,0:00:43.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Number two, do whatever you can to outsmart the other guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.88,0:00:43.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}准则第二条 不择手段以智取胜 打败别人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:46.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everywhere else is filled with Meredith's mom's boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:46.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其他地方都堆满了 梅若迪丝妈妈的箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:49.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith? When is your mom coming back to town, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:49.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝？ 你妈妈到底什么时候回来？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.46,0:00:51.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because maybe we can put her boxes in storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.46,0:00:51.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为也许我们可以 先把她的箱子收起来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:54.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or unpack a few things make this place more homey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是拆箱收拾一下 让这里更温馨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:56.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some throw pillows, some lamps, a few paintings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:56.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来些抱枕、台灯 再挂几幅画
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.42,0:00:57.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, paintings would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.42,0:00:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}挂画还不赖
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:00.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you have all this amazing stuff just packed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:00.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对啊 你有这么多好东西 只是都收在箱子里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.71,0:01:03.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In this back hall, I found this box with like 100 tapes of your mother
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.71,0:01:03.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还在后厅找到一个箱子 里面有一大堆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.33,0:01:05.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}performing these amazing medical procedures.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.33,0:01:05.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你妈妈执行手术的精彩录像带
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.25,0:01:07.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? We should watch them, Meredith. Do you want to watch...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.25,0:01:07.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？梅若迪丝 我们应该看看…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.21,0:01:14.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith, do you want some privacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.21,0:01:14.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝 你想单独静一静吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.50,0:01:21.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Number three, don't make friends with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.50,0:01:21.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}准则第三条 别与敌人为友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.62,0:01:28.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Morning, Dr. Bailey. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.62,0:01:28.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 早上好 贝利医生 - 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:34.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You realize that I'm an attending and you're only a resident.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:34.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道我是主治医生 而你只是住院医生吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.67,0:01:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That you work for me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.67,0:01:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是你上司 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know I've forgotten something. Something is happening today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我总觉得我忘了什么 今天有个什么事情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.12,0:01:42.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know I should know what it is, but I just can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.12,0:01:42.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我应该要知道是什么的 但我就是想不起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:48.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Nice talking with you, Dr. Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:48.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 和你聊天真愉快 贝利医生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's right in front of my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}明明快想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.17,0:01:51.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.17,0:01:51.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}医生…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.83,0:02:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Watch out. Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.83,0:02:00.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:07.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fools on bikes, killing themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:09.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}笨蛋骑单车找死 只能说是物竞天择
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:09.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Natural selection is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.67,0:02:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So what's up with the Nazi? Is she off her meds?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.67,0:02:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}纳粹她今天怎么了？她没吃药哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:13.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You never heard of the race?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:13.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没听说那比赛？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.62,0:02:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（手术日程表）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:16.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excellent board.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:16.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}安排完美
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.33,0:02:18.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well-timed, balanced, efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.33,0:02:18.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}时间掌控得宜 分配平均又有效率
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.50,0:02:20.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If all goes well, we'll have an early night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.50,0:02:20.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}顺利的话 我们都能提早下班
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:23.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chief, Dead Baby Bike Race started 20 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主任 死亡宝贝单车大赛 20分钟前开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:25.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, people! Dead Baby Bike Race day!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:25.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所有人听好了！ 死亡宝贝单车大赛日来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.83,0:02:27.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Every year, this bar... - The Dead Baby Bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.83,0:02:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 每年这个… - 死亡宝贝酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:30.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every year, they hold this underground bike race.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:30.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每年他们都举办这个地下单车赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:34.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you wonder why someone would name a bar something so disgusting?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:34.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么会有人把酒吧 取这么恶心的名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:36.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Keep your panties on, Nancy Drew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:36.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冷静点 好奇宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:39.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- The race is completely illegal and... - Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:39.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这比赛不但非法 还… - 疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.38,0:02:41.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A bunch of bike messengers racing against traffic,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.38,0:02:41.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一群单车快递员在车阵中竞速
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:43.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}trying to beat each other for free shots of tequila.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:43.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}设法打败其他人 只为了喝免费的龙舌兰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.83,0:02:47.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All-out, no-holds-barred competition sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.83,0:02:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毫无设限的比赛似乎挺好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you would think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是会这么以为
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:51.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The race doesn't even have any rules except eye-gouging. No eye-gouging.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:51.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那比赛只有一个规则 就是不能挖人眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll be trapped in the pit Band-Aiding idiots
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们今天都得帮一堆笨蛋包扎了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}when we could be up in the OR.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}本来可以进手术室的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.29,0:02:58.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What kind of people engage in a race that has, as its only rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.29,0:02:58.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么样的人会参加这种比赛？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:03:01.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that you can't rip out the eyeballs of another human being?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:03:01.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}唯一的规则居然是 不能把别人的眼球扯出来？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.62,0:03:02.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Men, Georgie. Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.62,0:03:02.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治 有人就是会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:07.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need someone to get up to the OR floor. The Chief needs a right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:07.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我需要有人去手术室那边 主任需要帮手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:10.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, and yeah, number four...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:10.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 还有准则第四条
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:13.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}George.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:13.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everything, everything, is a competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放眼所有 皆是竞争
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.12,0:03:20.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, people. The rules of trauma. Don't mingle with ER interns.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.12,0:03:20.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 大家注意 外伤科准则 别跟急诊实习生搅和
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:22.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They don't know their ass from esophagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:22.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们什么屁都不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:25.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sew fast, discharge fast. Get bodies up to the OR yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:25.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快速缝合 迅速出院 严重的就送上手术室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.83,0:03:28.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And don't let me catch you fighting over patients. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.83,0:03:28.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别让我发现你们在抢患者 懂了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:30.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:30.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it's like candy, but with blood, which is so much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就像染血糖果 真是太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.17,0:03:42.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, my God. - Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.17,0:03:42.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 天啊 - 给我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:43.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No! I saw him first!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:43.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行！是我先看到他的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:46.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoever said winning wasn't everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:46.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说胜利不代表一切的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:51.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ooh. I'll take that guy. - You'll have to beat me to him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:51.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那个人我要 - 那你得抢赢我才行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.38,0:03:53.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Never held a scalpel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.38,0:03:53.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}…一定从未拿过手术刀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.38,0:04:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}实习医生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:24.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Heads, he's mine. Tails, he's yours. - Why do you get to be "heads"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:24.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 正面归我 反面就给你 - 为什么你可以选正面？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, because I have a head, and honey, you are a tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我有脑子 亲爱的 而你背面有美臀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:28.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:28.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:30.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you manage to make everything dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:30.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么有办法让所有事都变下流？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:35.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tails. There are plenty of other cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:35.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是反面 还有许多其他患者等着你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:37.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, go get one. I was here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:37.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你去啊 是我先来的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:41.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am not backing down so I can do sutures all day while you're in the OR.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:41.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我绝不会让步 你休想让我 在这缝合伤口 而你自己在手术室
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:43.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a surgical case, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:43.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你明明知道这是外科患者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.46,0:04:46.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's superficial. I mean it's cool, but it's superficial.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.46,0:04:46.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是皮外伤 看上去很酷 但其实伤口很浅
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:48.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you know those things didn't rupture his peritoneum?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:48.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么知道他没有腹膜破裂？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.67,0:04:51.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because he's sitting up and he's sitting there talking to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.67,0:04:51.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他挺直坐着 还能和我们说话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:53.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello. Excuse me, I was wondering if you could
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:53.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思 你们能不能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.83,0:04:56.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}take these out and sew me up, so I could go and win my race.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.83,0:04:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先帮我把这些拔出来 然后缝合伤口 让我能继续去赢得比赛？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we can't just pull them out...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不能直接拔出来…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:05:02.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I mean, we have to do some tests... - Ow, wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:05:02.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 得先做一些检查… - 爽啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.29,0:05:04.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.29,0:05:04.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你疯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.25,0:05:06.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a superficial wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.25,0:05:08.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这只是皮外伤 帮他缝合伤口 让他完成比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.21,0:05:08.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sew him up and let him finish his race.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:10.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You... - Hey, good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:10.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你… - 你人真好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.83,0:05:12.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unidentified John Doe, mid-30s pedestrian,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.83,0:05:12.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}身份不明的无名氏 30几岁的路人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:14.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}hit by a motorist swerving to avoid a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:14.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他被闪避单车的摩托车撞到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:18.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}GCS 3. Pupils fixed and dilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}昏迷指数3 瞳孔固定扩散
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:23.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Atropine given for a pulse in the 40s. BP 183 over 112. Pulse-ox 98 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:23.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已注射阿托品 脉搏40 血压183/112 血氧98%
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:26.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chest showed widened mediastinum and head CT revealed cerebral edema.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:26.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}胸腔X光片可看出纵膈变宽 头部电脑断层扫描显示脑水肿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:30.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's gotten 70 of mannitol, dexamethasone 10 and a gram of phenytoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:30.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已为他注射70毫克甘露醇 10毫克地塞米松和1克苯妥英
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Give him to the OR?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}送他去手术室？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.46,0:05:34.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Is he gorked? - Looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.46,0:05:34.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他没救了吗？ - 似乎是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The bike race claims its first victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}单车比赛出现第一个受害者了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.12,0:05:40.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll make my AAA repair after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.12,0:05:40.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来我还是得去执行 腹主动脉瘤修复手术
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:43.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Shepherd? He's not going to the OR?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:43.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薛波医生？不送他去手术室吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:47.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. Do an EEG and confirmatory tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:47.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 帮他做脑电图与确认检验
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.62,0:05:51.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If he doesn't respond in six hours, declare him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.62,0:05:51.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果他六小时内都没有反应 就宣布吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:56.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Declare him? Declare him what? - Brain-dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:56.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 宣布？宣布什么？ - 脑死
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.25,0:06:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sir, Dr. Bailey sent me to assist you. Should I scrub in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.25,0:06:09.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主任 贝利医生派我来协助你 我该消毒进手术室吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.00,0:06:11.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I'm stuck here all day. I need you on the floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.00,0:06:11.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用 我整天都得在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:15.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- monitoring my pre and post-op patients. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:15.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你去巡房 帮我盯着 术前、术后患者的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.62,0:06:19.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You got a problem with that, O'Malley? - Oh, no, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.62,0:06:19.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 欧麦利 你有意见吗？ - 没有 主任
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.79,0:06:26.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A buddy of mine in 4451, Lloyd Mackie. Give him whatever he needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.79,0:06:26.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}4451号病房是我的老朋友 洛伊德麦基 满足他的一切需求
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:29.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:29.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.79,0:06:34.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（《商业日报》）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:45.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Mackie...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:45.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}麦基先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:47.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No smoking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:47.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}禁止吸烟！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.25,0:06:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- There's no smoking. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.25,0:06:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这里不能吸烟 - 为什么不行？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.42,0:06:53.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God! You're in a hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.42,0:06:53.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 这里是医院！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.83,0:06:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your point being?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.83,0:06:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:07:00.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know if you've listened to the surgeon general lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:07:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道你过去20年来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:02.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}say, in the past 20 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有没有听医务总监常说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:05.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but smoking is bad. Smoking will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:05.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吸烟有害健康 甚至会要了你的命
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.71,0:07:07.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Liver cancer will kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.71,0:07:07.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是肝癌会要了我的命
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.17,0:07:10.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Smoking will just speed up the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.17,0:07:10.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吸烟只是加速过程罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.83,0:07:14.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're at the top of the donor list for a new liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.83,0:07:14.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在等候肝脏移植名单的首位
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:16.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:16.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还有希望
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.17,0:07:19.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sweetheart, I've been at the top of the list for...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.17,0:07:19.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的 我在第一顺位已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:21.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}eight months.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:21.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}八个月了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not in a batter's cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以说不是上场投手了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:28.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm in a dugout, about to be traded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:28.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是坐板凳选手 准备被交易掉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.21,0:07:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You like baseball? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.21,0:07:31.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你喜欢棒球？ - 不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:33.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, the Chief wanted me to look in on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主任要我来关照你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:40.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Richard's a dear old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:40.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}理查德真是个好老友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:43.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's been my doctor for 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:43.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他担任我的医生已经30年了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:47.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, whatever you need, I'm your man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:47.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有任何需要找我就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:49.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:49.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}尽管开口
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:50.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:50.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:54.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sure I'll think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:54.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一定会有需要的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:03.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Absent corneal reflexes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:03.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有角膜反射
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:06.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's been 55 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:06.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已经55分钟了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If he doesn't respond to tests in the next five hours, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果接下来五小时 他都对检验没反应 那会怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:13.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're just supposed to stand here and watch him die?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:13.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道我们要坐视不管 眼睁睁看他死去？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.71,0:08:17.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If he doesn't respond to these tests, it's because he's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.71,0:08:17.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果他对检验毫无反应 代表他已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:19.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Technically. Legally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:19.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是学术和法律上的说法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:21.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, Izzie. Actually dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:21.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊兹 是事实上已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:23.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's breathing. He has a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:23.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他还在呼吸 也有心跳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at his EEG. There's no higher-brain function.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你瞧瞧他的脑电图 大脑上半区已经没运作了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:28.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He'll never talk, move or think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:28.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他再也无法说话、行动或思考
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:32.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no one in there. Think like a doctor, Izzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:32.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}此人已经不在了 伊兹 你得从医生角度思考
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.29,0:08:35.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He could wake up. What about a miracle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.29,0:08:35.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他有可能会醒来 不是会有奇迹吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.25,0:08:37.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are medical miracles, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.25,0:08:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有很多医学奇迹发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:40.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. You're right, miracles happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:40.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 你说得对 奇迹会发生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}People do wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:42.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有些人是会醒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:45.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, that's why we do a series of tests over a set number of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:45.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我们才要在规定时间内 进行一系列检验
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:47.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So when we call time of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:47.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么当我们宣布死亡时间时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:49.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}we know that we've done everything to make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:49.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}代表我们已经竭尽所能
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:51.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}it's actually his time of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:51.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}确定这是他真正的死亡时间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:54.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That there isn't gonna be any miracles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:54.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会再有任何奇迹发生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.21,0:09:00.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.21,0:09:00.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这很令人煎熬
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To stand around as surgeons and not cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}作为外科医生却无法动手术
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.42,0:09:07.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's what "do no harm" means.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.42,0:09:07.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这正是所谓的“不伤害原则”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.54,0:09:14.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wish he'd just go into the light already so I can get on another case.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.54,0:09:14.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真希望他已经上天堂了 这样我就能负责其他患者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:19.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'm the devil because I'd rather be in surgery
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:19.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道因为我情愿待在手术室 而不是站在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:22.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}instead of standing watch over the death squad? It's depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:22.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}照顾找死的家伙 我就成了魔鬼？ 太令人郁闷了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.58,0:09:31.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at his sneakers. They're brand new.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.58,0:09:31.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看他的运动鞋 是全新的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:34.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And somebody sewed this tear in his shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:34.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人帮他缝补好衬衫上的破口
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:36.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he has one of those electronic key cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:36.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且他还有电子房卡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:38.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He belongs to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:38.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是有归属的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.38,0:09:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}An hour ago, he was out there, alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.38,0:09:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一小时前他还活蹦乱跳的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:44.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To simply stand here and wait for him to die...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:44.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在却只能眼睁睁看着他死去…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:46.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It would be a waste of life. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:46.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 真是浪费生命 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:48.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It'd be a waste of organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:48.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也浪费了许多器官
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:09:58.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've got a nice touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:09:58.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你手真巧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:02.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, by the way, you are a rockin' babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:02.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 你还是个正点辣妹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.21,0:10:05.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously, do you actually think you have a shot here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.21,0:10:05.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说真的 你真认为自己有机会？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:07.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd like to think I've got a shot anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:07.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为自己到哪里都有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:08.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hmm. - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.75,0:10:12.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, you really have to let me take you for some tests. Run a CT.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.75,0:10:12.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 你真该让我帮你做些检查 做个电脑断层扫描
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:13.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You could have internal bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:13.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可能有内出血
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:15.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, thank you, I've got a race to get back to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:15.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不了 谢谢 我还得回去参加比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:18.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why? You can't win now, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:18.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？反正你也赢不了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:20.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doesn't mean I can't cross that finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:20.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就算赢不了 我还能越过终点线啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's a party at the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}终点那里有派对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.21,0:10:24.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you want to meet me there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.21,0:10:24.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要不要待会派对上见？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:28.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One test. A CT. I'll have you out of here in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:28.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就做个电脑断层检查就好 一小时就让你出院
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:29.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't do it. Got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:29.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恕难从命 我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:35.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you realize you're leaving against medical advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:35.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你知道这样是违反医嘱离院吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:37.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and that I strongly urge you to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:37.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可是强烈建议你留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:40.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- The frat guy said I could go. - The frat guy is an ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:40.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那个好兄弟说我可以走啊 - 那位兄弟是个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.17,0:10:45.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, well, you have to sign an AMA form.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.17,0:10:45.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你得签违反医嘱出院证明书
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:49.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Darling, I will do anything you want me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:49.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的 你想怎样我都听你的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.38,0:10:54.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is it with you guys and your need to dirty everything up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.38,0:10:54.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们男人到底有什么毛病 什么事都要说得那么下流？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.58,0:10:57.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. Maybe it's just testosterone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.58,0:10:57.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道 可能是睪酮作祟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:10:59.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:10:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:01.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You might want to see a doctor about that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:01.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你最好也找医生检查一下睪酮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:06.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:06.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:19.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was for good luck. Don't worry, darling, you'll see me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:19.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是为求好运 别担心 亲爱的 我们会再见面的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:23.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For your sake, I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:23.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为了你好 我希望别见了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.71,0:11:38.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.71,0:11:38.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.62,0:11:40.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You make out with patients now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.62,0:11:40.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你现在会和患者亲热？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.71,0:11:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What, are you jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.71,0:11:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么 你吃醋啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.92,0:11:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't get jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.92,0:11:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不会吃醋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- We had sex, once. - And we kissed in an elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们只是上过一次床 - 还在电梯里接吻了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:55.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And we kissed in an elevator, once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:55.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们在电梯里亲过一次而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:59.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No, seriously. Go out with me. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:59.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我是认真的 和我约会吧 - 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:02.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I almost died today. Yeah, I came, like, this close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我今天差点死了 真的是千钧一发
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:05.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How would you feel if I died
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:05.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若我死了 你却没和我约会过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:07.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and you didn't get a chance to go out with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:07.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会作何感想？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.83,0:12:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Get over yourself, already. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.83,0:12:10.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 拜托你少自恋了 - 别这样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:14.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It's the chase, isn't it? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:14.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你是享受追逐对吧？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:18.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The thrill of the chase. I've been wondering to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:18.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}追逐的快感 我一直在想
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Why are you so hell-bent on getting me to go out with you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“你干嘛费尽心思要跟我约会？”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:23.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know you're my boss, you know it's against the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你很清楚你是我的上司 也知道这违反规定
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:26.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you know I keep saying no. It's the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:26.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你明知道我会一直拒绝 所以你享受的是追逐过程
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.92,0:12:31.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Well, it's fun, isn't it? - You see? This is a game to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.92,0:12:31.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 很好玩 不是吗？ - 看吧 对你来说这是场游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:32.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But not to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:32.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但对我来说不是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:36.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because, unlike you, I still have something to prove.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:36.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我不像你 我还需要证明自己的实力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:41.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you see me resecting this bowel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:41.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们都看到我在切除肠道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:44.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do I strike you as someone who enjoys multitasking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:44.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道我是喜欢一心多用的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have a John Doe. In three hours, we have to declare him brain dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们这里有位无名氏 三小时后就得宣布他脑死
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.17,0:12:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- We want to harvest his organs. - Why are you wasting time on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.17,0:12:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们想要摘取他的器官 - 你们干嘛为此浪费时间？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:53.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know how many patients we have downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们楼下还有一堆患者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:57.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If he dies, and he could still live, his death should mean something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:57.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果他死了…虽说他还有可能活下去 就算死也应该要有点意义
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:01.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you want a harvest surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:01.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们想做器官摘除手术
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:03.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want to save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:03.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是想拯救更多生命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:07.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, I want a harvest surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:07.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我是想做器官摘除手术
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.25,0:13:09.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Getting organs from a John Doe is a long shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.25,0:13:09.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从无名氏身上摘取器官很不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.67,0:13:11.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Without ID, you can't contact the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.67,0:13:11.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有证件 就无法联系家属
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:15.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Without the family, you can't get consent to harvest the organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:15.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}找不到他们 就无法获得家属同意摘除器官
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:17.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Let the poor man die in peace. - What if we can find the family?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:17.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 让那可怜人安息吧 - 假如我们能找到他的家人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:20.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- And get consent. - We could harvest the organs?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:20.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 还要取得他们同意 - 那就能摘取器官了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you find the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}前提是找到他的家属
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What are you doing? - Hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你在做什么？ - 躲人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's this VIP patient. He likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}院内有位贵宾级患者 他喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.67,0:13:36.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.67,0:13:36.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是好事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:39.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He "likes me" likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:39.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是对我有意思的那种喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:43.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go for it, man. Get yours. I'm down with the rainbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上吧 老兄 去追求幸福 我不会歧视同性恋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:49.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you not gay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不是同性恋？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:53.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:53.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不是啊 - 真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:56.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dude, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:56.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老兄 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:03.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, Cristina?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:03.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克里斯廷娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:07.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you... Do you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:07.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:09.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does Meredith think I'm gay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:09.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝认为我是同性恋吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.21,0:14:11.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.21,0:14:11.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:13.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:13.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不是 - 真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:21.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I found this on our John Doe. It's a hotel key card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:21.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在无名氏患者身上 找到这张酒店房卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:23.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've called the police and they're going to send someone over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:23.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经通知警方 他们会派人过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:27.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe they can figure out what hotel he was staying at, get his ID from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:27.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许能查出他下榻的酒店 然后得知他的身份
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.25,0:14:28.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Could you? - I'll make sure the police get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.25,0:14:28.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你能否转交？ - 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:30.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK. It's just really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:30.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 这真的很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.71,0:14:32.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We only have a few hours before we have to declare him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.71,0:14:32.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们只剩几个小时 就得宣布他死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.83,0:14:35.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I'd really like to find his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.83,0:14:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的很想找到他的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:37.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want their permission for organ donation?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:37.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想让他们同意捐赠器官？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.38,0:14:42.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just... really want to find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.38,0:14:42.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是…真的很想找到他们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.29,0:14:46.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have a potential donor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.29,0:14:46.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有潜在器捐者？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:49.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's his blood type?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:49.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是什么血型？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}O-neg.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}阴性O型血
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I know you probably can't hear me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你大概听不见我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:09.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and you're feeling this big push to go towards the light,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:09.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你感受到自己被强大力量带往天堂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.75,0:15:14.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}where everything's all halos and all-you-can-eat buffets and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.75,0:15:14.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到处都是天使光环 有吃不完的美食之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, I mean, sharing your organs is really great and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}捐赠器官是很了不起的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.33,0:15:22.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but I think you have a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.33,0:15:22.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我认为你有家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:25.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:25.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我感觉得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:27.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I think it'd be really great
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:27.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以如果你能帮我个忙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:32.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}if you could do me a favor, and get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:31.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}赶快好起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.17,0:15:32.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.79,0:15:34.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.79,0:15:34.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.33,0:15:38.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.33,0:15:38.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, you think you can give that a shot for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:42.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以为我努力看看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.58,0:16:08.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.58,0:16:08.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:11.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:11.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.12,0:16:14.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Meredith. He's crashing. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.12,0:16:14.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 梅若迪丝 他要不行了 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.42,0:16:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell are you doing? Call a code!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.42,0:16:15.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你还在干嘛？快抢救！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.88,0:16:17.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't, I'm not supposed to. He's brain-dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.88,0:16:17.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 我不能那么做 他脑死了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Izzie, if he's brain-dead, you have to let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊兹 如果他脑死了 你就得放手让他走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:22.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. It's only been five hours and 33 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:22.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 才过了5小时33分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.42,0:16:23.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's supposed to get six hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.42,0:16:23.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他应该要撑到6小时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:25.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we can't do anything to help him live.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:25.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不能维持他的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.83,0:16:27.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not our place to make that call.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.83,0:16:27.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不该由我们说了算
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.83,0:16:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's a person. We're doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.83,0:16:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是活生生的人 我们是医生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:32.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We should have every right to make that call.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:32.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们应该完全有权做主
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.29,0:16:36.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We can't just stand here and do nothing while he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.29,0:16:36.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不能袖手旁观 眼睁睁看着他死去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.67,0:16:39.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He has a right to the next 27 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.67,0:16:39.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他还有权利活27分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:44.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Screw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:44.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:47.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll get the dopamine. You get the blood. We'll transfuse him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:47.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我去拿多巴胺 你去拿血浆 我们帮他输血
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:56.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you feel any pain here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:56.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里会感到疼痛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:16:57.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:16:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:17:02.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, you really do have beautiful eyelashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:17:02.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实你的眼睫毛真的很美
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:07.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you. What about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:07.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 那这里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.08,0:17:11.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. And nice eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.08,0:17:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会 你还有迷人双眸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:12.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:12.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:15.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I like a man with kind eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:15.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢有温柔眼神的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:17.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? You think I have kind eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:17.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？你觉得我有温柔眼神？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.42,0:17:20.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Mm-hmm. - I mean, you can, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.42,0:17:20.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说 你能…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.58,0:17:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you examining me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.58,0:17:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在帮我做什么检查？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:28.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you know, just routine medical stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:28.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是例行检查罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.79,0:17:32.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You're doing very well. - Because I'm enjoying the view.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.79,0:17:32.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你的状况良好 - 因为我在欣赏眼前美景
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK. Well... I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 我该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.17,0:17:45.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- He's stable. - For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.17,0:17:45.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他的情况稳定 - 暂时而已
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:49.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had a radiologist look at his chest. He has a traumatic aortic injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我让放射科医生看了胸腔X光片 他有创伤性主动脉损伤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:51.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- He's gonna rupture and bleed out. - So, he needs surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:51.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 之后会破裂导致内出血 - 他需要动手术
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:53.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If he's gonna remain a viable organ donor. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:53.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果他还要捐赠器官的话 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:54.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If he's gonna live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:54.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是如果他要活下去才对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:56.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Izzie... - No, I'm not giving up on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:56.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 伊兹… - 我不会放弃他的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:17:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He has the surgery, he lives longer. That's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:17:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他动手术就能活久一点 这才是重点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.38,0:18:00.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm going to find the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.38,0:18:00.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要帮忙找他的家属
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.42,0:18:02.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys find a way to get him into surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.42,0:18:02.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们想办法帮他动手术
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:04.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's vice president of Fantasyland.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:04.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她还真是充满正能量啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.83,0:18:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So who do we go to for the surgery. Bailey?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.83,0:18:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我们要找谁做手术 贝利吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.29,0:18:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We need to go higher than Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.29,0:18:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们得找贝利的上级
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.33,0:18:11.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.33,0:18:11.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}柏克医生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:13.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hello! - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:13.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 喂！ - 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.25,0:18:19.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Burke, I know you're busy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.25,0:18:19.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}柏克医生 我知道你正在忙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but our John Doe needs an aortic repair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们的无名氏患者需要修复动脉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.33,0:18:26.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The guy from this morning? Isn't he legally dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.33,0:18:26.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今早那个人？ 法律上他不是已经死亡了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.21,0:18:29.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, yeah... He's kinda still around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.21,0:18:29.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯…他还没完全断气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:33.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We gave him two units PRVCs and put him on pressors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:33.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呼吸器用了PRVC模式 输入两单位血浆 并稳定住血压
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.67,0:18:34.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On whose orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.67,0:18:34.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁准你们这么做的？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:45.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You get a brain-dead John Doe a blood transfusion
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:45.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们没先请示任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.75,0:18:47.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}without consulting anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.75,0:18:47.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就擅自帮脑死无名氏患者输血
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.42,0:18:49.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And now you want me to repair his heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.42,0:18:49.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在还要我修复他的心脏？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:50.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:50.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:56.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You do enjoy crossing the line, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:56.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们还真喜欢违反规定啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.50,0:18:59.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He is an excellent candidate for organ donation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.50,0:18:59.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是绝佳器捐候选人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.46,0:19:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am a surgeon. I save lives. This guy is already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.46,0:19:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是外科医生 志在救人 那家伙已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.21,0:19:07.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, this is the men's room. Either whip one out, or close the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.21,0:19:07.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且这里是男厕 不掏家伙出来上厕所就关门
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.21,0:19:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You're asking my advice? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.21,0:19:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你来向我讨教？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.08,0:19:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now who's chasing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.08,0:19:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是谁追谁了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:17.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Not funny. This is important. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:17.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不好笑 这事关重大 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:20.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want to get around Burke?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:20.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们想绕过柏克？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.75,0:19:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You gotta find a way to get the Chief involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.75,0:19:22.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就得设法让主任帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What'd I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我哪里惹到你了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:30.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How close a match for the liver is your guy to our John Doe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:30.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无名氏和你患者的肝脏有多匹配？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:33.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Very. Same type, same size. UNO couldn't find a better match. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常匹配 同血型、同大小 我都想说是天作之合了 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.54,0:19:36.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's the Chief's VIP, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.54,0:19:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是主任的贵宾患者 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:37.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:37.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:40.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How much would you kill to be in on the transplant surgery?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:40.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有多想参加移植手术？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.75,0:19:43.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.75,0:19:43.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们低估我了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:46.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not a baby. I'm your colleague.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:46.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是小孩子 我是你们的同僚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:48.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't have to manipulate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:48.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不需要诱导我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you want something, all you have to do is ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们想要我干什么 直说便行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:53.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We want you to go over Burke's head, to the Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:53.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要你越过柏克 直接找主任
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:56.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ask me something easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我做简单一点的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.04,0:19:59.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.04,0:19:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主任
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.12,0:20:01.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- O'Malley. How's Mackie? - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.12,0:20:01.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 欧麦利 麦基情况如何？ - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.00,0:20:03.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sir, actually, that's what I want to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.00,0:20:03.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主任 其实我正是想找你谈他的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I kinda think that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:08.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me and the other interns... We think...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:08.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我和其他实习医生觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.42,0:20:11.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}O'Malley, I'm not getting any younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.42,0:20:11.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欧麦利 别吞吞吐吐的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.79,0:20:13.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We found Mackie a liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.79,0:20:13.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们找到适合麦基的肝了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.38,0:20:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We are so going to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.38,0:20:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.17,0:20:18.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Burke is sending us straight to hell. - On an express train.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.17,0:20:18.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 柏克会把我们打入地狱 - 高速直达地府
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:20.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:20.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}前提是这招成功
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.67,0:20:22.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.67,0:20:22.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.67,0:20:23.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.67,0:20:23.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:31.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.83,0:20:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.83,0:20:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.21,0:20:47.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Burke! Dr. Burke!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.21,0:20:47.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}柏克医生！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.71,0:20:52.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excellent work, sir. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.71,0:20:52.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}您的手术技艺真精湛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.29,0:20:54.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.29,0:20:54.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完美无瑕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:55.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a shame he's brain-dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:55.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真可惜他已经脑死
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:58.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If he wasn't, he would be on his feet in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:58.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不然他过几天就能渐渐康复了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.71,0:21:01.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm amazed at what's going on. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.71,0:21:01.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的是大开眼界…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:06.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I seriously hate that guy. - Alex is vermin. That surgery is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:06.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我实在很讨厌那家伙 - 亚力克是毒瘤 手术本该是我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:08.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At least Burke is doing the surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:08.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}起码柏克在做手术了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.25,0:21:09.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care about Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.25,0:21:09.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不管亚力克
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.92,0:21:12.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}George, you did good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.92,0:21:12.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治 干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:15.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna have to dodge Burke for the rest of my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:15.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以后在医界都得躲着柏克了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:20.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He could kill me and make it look like an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:20.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他可能会杀了我 还布置成意外
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.54,0:21:26.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The police called. They've identified your John Doe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.54,0:21:26.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}警方来电了 他们确认了无名氏身份
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.62,0:21:27.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His wife is on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.62,0:21:27.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的妻子正赶过来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.75,0:21:45.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.75,0:21:45.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.29,0:21:47.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.29,0:21:47.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凯文！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:50.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It's OK. - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:50.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 进去没关系 - 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:53.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mrs. Davidson, this is Dr. Stevens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:53.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}戴维森太太 这位是史蒂文斯医生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.83,0:21:58.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, if you have any questions at all, please, please call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.83,0:21:58.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你有任何疑问 请来找我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.50,0:22:10.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.50,0:22:10.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.12,0:22:13.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there still a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.12,0:22:13.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有没有希望？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.71,0:22:18.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We can hold off till morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.71,0:22:18.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以等到明天早上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but if there's still no change, we'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但若届时依然没有起色 我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.00,0:22:25.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'd like to talk to you about organ donation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.00,0:22:25.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会想和你谈谈器官捐赠的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.92,0:22:39.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mackie?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.92,0:22:39.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}麦基？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.50,0:22:41.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How are we treating ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.50,0:22:41.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们把你照顾得如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:44.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:44.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.88,0:22:48.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Except that beautiful boy won't let me smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.88,0:22:48.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}唯一缺点就是小帅哥不让我抽烟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.50,0:22:51.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should reprimand him.
