Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.33,0:26:32.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That two women caught the harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.33,0:26:32.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两个女人能参加摘除手术
