Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.08,0:28:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道要我举办葬礼 让大家看到他那个样子…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.25,0:28:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have his daughter look at her father and he doesn't have any skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.25,0:28:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让他女儿看到没有皮肤的父亲？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.88,0:28:10.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's his skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.88,0:28:10.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是他的皮肤！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.25,0:28:34.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.25,0:28:34.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.88,0:28:37.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm not a people person. - No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.88,0:28:37.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我不善与人交际 - 可不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.92,0:28:41.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't do that. I can't talk to the families of patients. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.92,0:28:41.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我办不到 我无法和病患家属沟通 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.00,0:28:45.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What's his name? - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.00,0:28:45.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他叫什么？ - 谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.25,0:28:47.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The patient. What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.25,0:28:47.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那名患者叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.96,0:28:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Kevin Davidson. - Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.96,0:28:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 凯文戴维森 - 牢牢记住
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.04,0:28:55.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not "gorked guy". Not "John Doe". Kevin Davidson.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.04,0:28:55.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是“植物人”也不是“无名氏” 而是凯文戴维森
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.58,0:28:57.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's someone's husband, someone's son,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.58,0:28:57.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是某人的丈夫、某人的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.83,0:29:00.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}not a collection of body parts for you to harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.83,0:29:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是让你收集器官的尸体而已
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.17,0:29:04.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A person. Now, no one said this was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.17,0:29:04.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是一个人 没人说这很容易
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.00,0:29:17.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Where am I? Who are you? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.83,0:29:24.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ I swear I've never been here before ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.88,0:29:26.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I owe you, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.88,0:29:26.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我欠你一个人情 乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.75,0:29:29.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you don't owe me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.75,0:29:31.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不欠我什么 我很高兴我们找到一个肝脏了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.62,0:29:31.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just happy we found a liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.96,0:29:35.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, when I get out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.96,0:29:35.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等我出院后
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.75,0:29:39.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}how about I take you and my new liver out for a night on the town?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.75,0:29:39.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不如我带你 和我的新肝脏去城里玩一晚？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.21,0:29:42.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.21,0:29:42.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你意下如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.21,0:29:50.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Mackie, no offense or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.21,0:29:50.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}麦基先生 我无意冒犯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.33,0:29:54.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're very handsome, but, I, uh, I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.33,0:29:54.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你非常帅 但我不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.21,0:29:57.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, you're not my type because...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.21,0:29:57.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不是我的菜 因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.17,0:29:59.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're a man, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.17,0:29:59.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是男人 而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.50,0:30:02.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}George, I never thought you were gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.50,0:30:02.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治 我从没认为你是同性恋
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.33,0:30:07.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You didn't? - Oh, child, please. You? Gay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.33,0:30:07.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 没有吗？ - 小子 拜托 你怎么会是同性恋？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.04,0:30:11.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sick, George, not blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.04,0:30:11.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是生病了 乔治 但眼睛没瞎
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.33,0:30:12.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But then, why have...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.33,0:30:12.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你之前为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.42,0:30:18.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because dying is a "get out of jail free" card.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.42,0:30:18.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为病危垂死就像有豁免权
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.58,0:30:20.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can be as bold as I want,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.58,0:30:20.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我大可任意妄为
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.75,0:30:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and there's nothing anybody can say about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.75,0:30:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且没人能说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.00,0:30:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I flirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.00,0:30:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我就打情骂俏了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.83,0:30:28.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Haven't you been attracted to someone you know you couldn't have?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.83,0:30:28.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道你从没喜欢过一个 明知追不到的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.62,0:30:31.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well... I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.62,0:30:31.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个嘛…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.25,0:30:34.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.25,0:30:34.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.54,0:30:35.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.54,0:30:35.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.92,0:30:38.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.92,0:30:38.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.79,0:30:40.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.79,0:30:40.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.54,0:30:42.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.54,0:30:42.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.46,0:30:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is really...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.46,0:30:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这实在是…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.92,0:30:46.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}not...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.92,0:30:46.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.58,0:30:51.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.58,0:30:51.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.54,0:30:57.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.54,0:30:57.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.67,0:31:03.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To be young and in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.67,0:31:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}年轻人谈谈恋爱真好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.46,0:31:16.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Let's go get that liver, shall we? - No, I'm sorry, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.46,0:31:16.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们去取那个肝脏吧？ - 不 抱歉 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.08,0:31:19.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.08,0:31:19.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.46,0:31:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I never liked harvesting. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.46,0:31:31.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我一直都不喜欢摘取器官 - 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.38,0:31:35.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like I said, I'm a surgeon. I save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.38,0:31:35.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如我所说 我是外科医生 志在救人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.00,0:31:37.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This ends one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.00,0:31:37.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是结束一条生命
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.00,0:31:44.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you tried, so no hard feelings, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.00,0:31:44.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你尽力了 别难过 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.67,0:31:51.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I was just... - You were saying goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.67,0:31:51.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我只是… - 和他道别
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.50,0:32:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's Viper doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.50,0:32:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毒蛇怎么来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.00,0:32:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Probably crashed his bike. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.00,0:32:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他可能又摔车了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.50,0:32:17.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How long has he been waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.50,0:32:17.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他等了多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.46,0:32:20.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. I've been busy on real cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.46,0:32:20.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道 我忙着处理要紧的病例
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.21,0:32:22.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.21,0:32:22.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他归你了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.12,0:32:25.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.12,0:32:25.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毒蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.83,0:32:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Viper?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.83,0:32:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毒蛇？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.88,0:32:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.88,0:32:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.21,0:32:33.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Viper!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.21,0:32:33.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毒蛇！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.25,0:32:36.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.33,0:32:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Call up to the OR and tell them we're coming, and page Dr. Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.33,0:32:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}联系手术室 通知他们我们要过去 呼叫贝利医生
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.12,0:32:45.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Right away. - Alex, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.12,0:32:45.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这就去 - 亚力克 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.04,0:32:48.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alex, push the damn gurney!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.04,0:32:48.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亚力克 快推该死的轮床！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.17,0:32:53.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Clear the way. Coming through. - Somebody get the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.17,0:32:53.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 清空走道 让一让 - 谁快去按电梯
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.25,0:32:56.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hurry. I don't know how long I can keep this wound closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.25,0:32:56.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快点 我不确定伤口什么时候会裂开
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.04,0:33:03.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Move faster. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.04,0:33:03.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快一点 可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.75,0:33:12.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, this a new one? Somebody get her off my patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.75,0:33:12.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}新患者吗？ 谁帮忙让她从我患者身上下来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.08,0:33:17.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith, get cleaned up and scrub in. Alex, back downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.08,0:33:17.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝 去清洁消毒进手术室 亚力克 回楼下去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.25,0:33:18.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah, but I helped. - Helped?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.25,0:33:18.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好 但我帮忙了 - 帮忙？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.75,0:33:22.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, they tell me down in the pit, you only wanna take the hot cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.75,0:33:22.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}急诊那边告诉我 你只肯接好病例
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.29,0:33:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every pack of interns,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.29,0:33:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每一批实习生中
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.92,0:33:27.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}there's always one fool running around trying to show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.92,0:33:27.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总会有个傻瓜到处炫耀自己
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.42,0:33:30.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, Alex, this time that fool is you. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.42,0:33:30.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亚力克 这次的傻瓜就是你 出去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.50,0:33:36.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get me something to stand on. Lower this table.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.50,0:33:36.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁帮我拿个垫脚的 降低手术台
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.71,0:33:38.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The mountain is gonna have to come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.71,0:33:38.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}必须让他配合我的高度
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.25,0:33:42.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Count backwards from 10 for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.25,0:33:42.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帮我从十开始倒数
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.96,0:33:44.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.96,0:33:44.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}理查德
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.21,0:33:46.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're a good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.21,0:33:46.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真是个好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.25,0:33:48.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The best.
