Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.46,0:33:51.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shut up and count backwards already, Mack.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.46,0:33:51.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别说了 快从十开始倒数 麦基
