Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.50,0:41:30.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Victories are counted by the number of lives saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.50,0:41:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所谓胜利的衡量标准 在于拯救了多少条人命
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.12,0:41:32.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ It always is ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.29,0:41:34.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ It always was and ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.96,0:41:40.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Love was surely made for fools like me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.58,0:41:45.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Fools like me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.50,0:41:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, OK. This is the best part. Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.50,0:41:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 这是最精采的部分 看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.12,0:41:49.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She pulls the flap of skin down over the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.12,0:41:49.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她取下脸皮了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.25,0:41:53.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- We were... - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.25,0:41:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们… - 你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.46,0:41:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were... we were just...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.46,0:41:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.67,0:41:57.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cristina made us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.67,0:41:57.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是克里斯廷娜逼我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.29,0:42:04.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, once in a while, if you're smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.29,0:42:07.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且如果你够聪明 有时候 你所拯救的会是自己的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.38,0:42:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the life you save could be your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.38,0:42:08.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are we watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.38,0:42:08.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们在看什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.25,0:42:12.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is the one where my mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.25,0:42:12.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这一卷是我妈妈在…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.92,0:42:15.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Literally pulls this guy's face off. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.92,0:42:15.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 把整张脸皮扯下来 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.54,0:42:20.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, come on! - Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.54,0:42:20.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 天啊！ - 太扯了！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.46,0:42:24.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Or just the sweetest kind of dream ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.71,0:42:27.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ But love was surely made ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.00,0:42:32.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ For fools like me ♪
